          ],
          "retained": [
            "Replace the quadratic blocked grid with per-row obstacle lists and one reusable packed bitmap.",
            "Scan set bits to delimit contiguous free-cell runs without sorting obstacle lists.",
            "Use one in-place DP row, carry the left value in a scalar, and replace modular division with conditional subtraction."
          ]
